# Supabase Realtime — the transport for patient <-> staff sync.
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com, then copy
# Project Settings -> Data API -> Project URL + anon public key.
# Both are public by design (they are shipped to the browser); the app
# uses Realtime Presence only and never reads or writes a table.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional. Microsoft Clarity project id — session replays and heatmaps.
# Left unset, no analytics script is served at all, which is what you want in
# development. Nothing is masked, so replays show what was actually typed —
# useful for finding bugs, and the reason the form asks people not to enter real
# information. A real deployment would mask the form, the receipt and the front
# desk list first.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLARITY_ID=
